        <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant "><strong>Powered by Redis Edge Infrastructure</strong></span>
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="font-headline-lg text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold text-on-surface tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Lightning-Fast URLs. <br/>
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent">Infinite Possibilities.</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="font-body-lg text-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">
        Transform unruly links into short, memorable tracking aliases instantly. Built for developers, marketers, and high-speed redirection at the edge.
      </p>
    </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Features Section -->
    <div id="features" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mt-32">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline-md text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface">Engineered for Performance</h2>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Everything you need to manage, track, and scale your links effortlessly.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Feature 1 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">speed</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Sub-Millisecond Routing</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Leveraging distributed memory caches to guarantee lightning-fast global redirects with near-zero latency.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 2 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-secondary mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">security</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Secure JWT Auth</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Robust cryptographic authentication ensuring your shortened custom endpoints and tracking metrics stay completely secure.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-tertiary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-tertiary-fixed-variant mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">analytics</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Real-Time Analytics</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Gain immediate visibility into click-through counts, referral sources, and geographic distribution metrics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

